.TH MIMAGE 1 "May 2026" "1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mimage \- Convert old Macintosh floppy images into .raw files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mimage
[\fIIMAGE_FILE\fR] [\fIOUTPUT_FILE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mimage
is a wrapper for the Macintosh.exe utility (by ZrX). It facilitates the 
conversion of legacy Macintosh floppy disk images into a raw stream format 
suitable for low-level disk writing tools.
.PP
Supported formats include .image, .img, and .dsk.
.SH OPTIONS
This program does not have standard command-line options. Pass the input 
image and the desired output filename as arguments.
.SH AUTHOR
Written by Roberto Chichiarelli, based on the original utility by ZrX.
.SH REPORTING BUGS
Report bugs to <roberto.chichiarelli@gmail.com>.
